# Offline-first: a quit never blocks on the radio. Save changed + dark -> the ROM is queued
# for the daemon and the offline path is honestly logged. No engine call at all.
desc push: save changed + offline -> save queued to pending-saves.txt, STATE queued via --queue-state
invoke wrap
config paired
wifi down
sdfile+ Roms/GBA/Zelda.gba
stockwrites Saves/CurrentProfile/saves/mGBA/Zelda.srm
engine 0|RESULT queuedstate=1
expect_exit 0
expect_trace STOCK GBA rom=
expect_trace ENGINE --queue-state
expect_file_has App/LodorSync/data/pending-saves.txt Zelda.gba
expect_log save changed, offline -> queued pending
expect_log state offline -> queued for daemon
